66y5ZCUVZKmAE1tPwoxQ7gTBRLBtYv7S7CA&oe=699F06C7"}, {"file_name": "screen-3.png", "id": "1003454831259726", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441584_1003454834593059_4414683215204598073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GhFSlObTilEQ7kNvwGZOxs8&_nc_oc=AdmQpb61qOEFZKRZUP59ESovX01COujGRMS3HuMauLSJctoptgBPbcRirANA5zbQkfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftqvwe9Hl_j5XmrYM1--vPlLGFow51k2gnpFlbesh39_A&oe=699ED9DE"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "1017662276733473", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75245822_1017662280066806_3140249560059418966_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ho4nTj_rF4Q7kNvwFvoPQF&_nc_oc=AdkeE-Cv1zhhLgysuWljffZcvUGydld1XCydcwjZUjVdJL5KJmCiDP4M85BJWqchnDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft05pKhfRWsPT5AUENDa_r1oJXOAmG4izFEFd-Tx43kXA&oe=699EDF8F"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1132731301130632", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375083_1132731304463965_2489209119133489696_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HbgbScHzK4sQ7kNvwFQUuq9&_nc_oc=AdmMN032HvkZiSe-WMa4nIRANEe6hIxWbM_dzaYwQo587x0FEB12P0rYKvfpDgmECT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftXJABBIAs7RgiaUQL8R4bHNfH5f5MxW7z1doi209-zuw&oe=699EF1C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod2_Title.png", "id": "1212771323096726", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036673_1212771326430059_1176351761076307841_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hEQbp6RQET0Q7kNvwGbnvTu&_nc_oc=AdlGkNo7gPCxY--l3Arn2s2raFbsG8Zdm8DXo0SxHMz0jsxDxrnxmrGRr6n8l_OLFOc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuUGud3a5o7g40o2_Oz_XpxvwmMAenT0iIq9mEf7kG5Ag&oe=699EE288"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 2: Masonry Wood Insert", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Module 02 Wood Burning Fireplace Inserts VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application trains users in the critical skills needed to inspect and maintain wood-burning fireplace inserts to NCSG standards. The course features interactive slides, desktop activities, real-world simulations, and integrates with a Learning Management System. It challenges students with inspections of randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring they follow all necessary procedures.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning fireplace inserts.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning fireplace inserts and their common features.\n\n**Fireplace Insert Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning fireplace inserts.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Fireplace Inserts VR application equips users with the critical skills necessary to inspect and maintain wood-burning fireplace inserts according to NCSG standards. This in-depth course includes interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and comprehensive testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app", "developer_terms_of_service